sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Next.js UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant OR as Master Orchestrator
    participant AG as Specialist Agent
    participant OL as Ollama
    participant DB as ChromaDB
    participant ST as Chat JSON

    User->>UI: Submit task
    UI->>API: POST /api/chats/{id}/message
    API->>ST: Load recent history
    API->>ST: Append user message
    API->>OR: handle(task, history)
    OR->>OL: Route task
    OL-->>OR: Agent list and plan
    loop Selected agents
        OR->>AG: Execute task with context
        AG->>OL: Generate / embed / OCR
        AG->>DB: Retrieve or upsert documents
        AG-->>OR: Agent output
    end
    OR-->>API: Final answer and steps
    API->>ST: Append assistant message
    API-->>UI: SSE events
    UI-->>User: Render answer and sources
